%% odvi_listen: one push() of a PCM block, through to an event on stdout.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant In as stdin (S16LE)
    participant Dec as RawPcmDecoder
    participant LL as ListenLoop
    participant Rs as Resampler
    participant Seg as StreamingUtteranceSegmenter
    participant ASR as Transcriber (whisper.cpp)
    participant Out as stdout (JSON Lines)

    In->>Dec: bytes, any split
    Dec->>LL: push(mono float block, input rate)
    LL->>Rs: process(block)
    Rs-->>LL: 16 kHz samples, anti-aliased
    LL->>Seg: push(16 kHz samples)
    Note over Seg: 20 ms frames → VAD → IDLE / SPEECH / ENDING
    Seg-->>LL: completed utterances (0..n)
    loop each utterance
        LL->>ASR: transcribe(whole utterance), exactly once
        ASR-->>LL: AsrResult (text or error, decode ms)
        LL->>Out: TranscriptEvent as one JSON line
    end
